<db:section xml:id="details">
<db:title>Detailed Description</db:title>
<db:para>This class tests that QDoc reads the definition of a macro that starts the declaration of an explicitly defaulted function, and marks the function as <db:code>constexpr</db:code> only when the macro says so.</db:para>
</db:section>
